            <ArticleTitle>Parasitic manifestation of testicular pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>42</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Genital filariasis is common in endemic areas of the world. However, filariasis cannot be eliminated from the differential diagnosis of scrotal swellings, as international travel is more frequent. We report a case in a patient in London, UK.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
